<title>USA: Cayman Water awaits takeover decision.</title>
<headline>Cayman Water awaits takeover decision.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cayman Water Co on Tuesday said it was awaiting the decision of the Cayman Islands government on the application by Argyle Partners Ltd seeking approval of its proposed acquisition of up to 50 percent of the water company's common stock.</p>
<p>Cayman Water said it retained the legal firm of Skadden, Arps, Slate, Meagher &amp; Flom to advise it on matters related to the Schedule 13D filed by Argyle with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
</text>
